# CI / release

- Workflow: `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (Python, Workflows, release)
- Release: `.github/actions/ci/release` + `linters/releaserc.json`
- Manter `conventional-changelog-conventionalcommits@9` (evitar writer@8 vs preset@10)
- Diagnosticar com `gh run list` / `gh run view --log-failed` no repo correto
- Doc: `docs/engineering-ci-release.md`; skill: `recon-ci-release`
